{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Tile Kingdom&quot;</i> is a <i>strategic</i>\u00a0city-building game where you place your terrain into empty grids and expand your territory. You will earn reputation and become a real king. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place terrains, earn reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572670/extras/place.gif?t=1741276194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjoin terrains, build area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572670/extras/adjoin.gif?t=1741276194\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close area, earn bonus reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572670/extras/area.gif?t=1741276194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We offer different modes and difficulties, you can play it relaxing or challenge it with difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572670/extras/mode.gif?t=1741276194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your territory expansion, you can buy more tiles from the shop, keep the expansion in your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572670/extras/shop.gif?t=1741276194\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572670?t=1741276194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572670?t=1741276194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s